    %% User-initiated triggers (top of graph)
    UserDrag[User drags drawer left-edge]
    UserType[User types URL + Enter]
    UserNavBtn[User clicks back/fwd/reload/stop]
    UserToggleBtn[User clicks toggle button]
    UserKbd[User hits Cmd+Shift+B]
    UserResize[User resizes window]
    UserDPR[User drags window to other-DPR monitor]
    UserCanvasOpen[User opens canvas drawer]
    UserUpdateBanner[UpdateBanner shows/hides]
    UserQuit[User quits app]

